{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-arrowkey-nav#card-zh","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-arrowkey-nav","commit":"a6fb7838337b5289ef10cfc3392be39dd1388314","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-arrowkey-nav 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的方向键导航插件。它在浏览器文档上注册键盘监听器，读取 DSH 的会话与工作区快照；上、下方向键在当前工作区循环切换会话，左、右方向键按工作区顺序切换。切换后会尝试将目标行滚动到视野中；从空输入框触发时会把焦点送回输入框，有草稿时则保留方向键给光标编辑。插件也会优先复用目标工作区的空白会话或最近更新会话。适合习惯键盘操作、需要快速浏览多个 DSH 会话和工作区的用户。需要安装到 DSH Web profile，并使用声明兼容范围内的 DSH 版本；不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:40-72","src/client/session-nav.ts:125-172","src/client/apply.ts:88-117"]}
{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-arrowkey-nav#card-en","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-arrowkey-nav","commit":"a6fb7838337b5289ef10cfc3392be39dd1388314","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-arrowkey-nav adds arrow-key navigation to DSH Web. Up/Down cycle sessions in the current workspace; Left/Right switch workspaces. It scrolls toward the target row and restores focus to an empty composer, while drafts keep their caret keys. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:40-72","src/client/session-nav.ts:125-172","src/client/apply.ts:88-117"]}
