{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-arrowkey-nav#feature-1","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-arrowkey-nav","commit":"a6fb7838337b5289ef10cfc3392be39dd1388314","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-arrowkey-nav 的功能「会话导航」：按上、下方向键在当前工作区的可见会话间循环切换；遇到单个会话或没有当前会话时不消费按键。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/navigate.ts:254-268"]}
